#: ../../adr/0011-algorithm-layer-direct-call.md:2
#: 6facec0d83b04273a4e6dbbc576062b9
msgid "ADR 0011：算法层直调（绕过 Facade 门面）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0011-algorithm-layer-direct-call.md:4
#: 73598b82d34f49b6aeefb64bbc5b98dc
msgid "**状态**：已接受 **日期**：2026-08-04 **关联**：ADR 0006（e2m2e GUI 前端定位）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0011-algorithm-layer-direct-call.md:8
#: 5a902e31adba451f96780c5a588103f1
msgid "背景"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0011-algorithm-layer-direct-call.md:10
#: 4032a01bb41f4939b6753f529841cf3f
msgid ""
"e2m2e 的 Facade 门面（`e2m2e.api.Facade`）是 MCP/CLI 的统一入口。但 Facade 的返回值是 "
"Pydantic 模型（`DesignOrbitResponse` 等），这些模型**剥离了轨道数据**：只返回标量汇总（轨道类型、Jacobi "
"常数、收敛标志），不返回 `Orbit` 对象或 `EphemerisTable`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0011-algorithm-layer-direct-call.md:12
#: e51aab47addd4a93b058a9e8be13dc28
msgid ""
"GUI 的可视化需要完整的轨道状态矩阵（`cr3bp_orbit.states` 形状 (n, "
"6)）和星历表（`ephemeris.position_km`）。这些数据被 Facade 门面丢弃了。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0011-algorithm-layer-direct-call.md:14
#: d36c701d501f43fe9f1f1c4fe6047bba
msgid "决策"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0011-algorithm-layer-direct-call.md:16
#: 9210071375554fefbcb12ceeedabedb4
msgid ""
"GUI **直接调用 e2m2e 算法层**（`e2m2e.algorithm.design.design_orbit` 等），不经过 "
"Facade 门面。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0011-algorithm-layer-direct-call.md:28
#: 304d8f9e2a0344e894d0f02423702d3e
msgid "理由"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0011-algorithm-layer-direct-call.md:30
#: 6982dfd8086d44129ab991249227c2dc
msgid ""
"**可视化需要完整数据**：OrbitVisualizer 需要 `Orbit.states`，不是 "
"`DesignOrbitResponse.initial_state`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0011-algorithm-layer-direct-call.md:31
#: 04864c5b62754907a8e0ffc18c3cc511
msgid ""
"**Facade 是为 MCP/CLI 设计的**：MCP 传输层不需要 numpy 数组（JSON 序列化太重）。GUI "
"作为进程内集成者，可以直接使用 numpy 数据。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0011-algorithm-layer-direct-call.md:32
#: f3a546d2ee0d4d64979745a353e154d5
msgid "**性能**：省去 Facade 层的 Pydantic 序列化/反序列化开销。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0011-algorithm-layer-direct-call.md:33
#: fd30d0c1c9e44757ab18b80adfd3c8a6
msgid "**e2m2e 架构对齐**：e2m2e ADR 0011 明确算法层保留细粒度 API（专家用），GUI 就是这个专家用户。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0011-algorithm-layer-direct-call.md:35
#: 1307104e2f94403ea55a6983357bcaf8
msgid "后果"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0011-algorithm-layer-direct-call.md:37
#: 4ac6164051ef4917bdd468b56625df6d
msgid "正面"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0011-algorithm-layer-direct-call.md:39
#: 4bf0d87a40894692bbb85cc663308a1e
msgid "可视化数据完整"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0011-algorithm-layer-direct-call.md:40
#: 16e86a0a5308474a80d78883c53ad4e6
msgid "无信息损失"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0011-algorithm-layer-direct-call.md:41
#: 93fec84b0d454370a91d94f0a0e5f52c
msgid "调用链更短"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0011-algorithm-layer-direct-call.md:43
#: c479707cd7c5454ab9f58e6ec5b403f9
msgid "负面"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0011-algorithm-layer-direct-call.md:45
#: 3dbc0daa9d8b47de8c62c4e7a1099dbe
msgid "不经过 Pydantic 参数校验（需要在 GUI 侧自行校验，或在 FacadeBridge 中做轻量校验）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0011-algorithm-layer-direct-call.md:46
#: f46d73f838be448ab4a748177858b6cd
msgid "耦合 e2m2e 算法层的函数签名（签名变更会影响 tod）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0011-algorithm-layer-direct-call.md:47
#: 096537de592842009eda9f930912d20c
msgid "Facade 门面更新后不需要同步（双刃剑：灵活但可能 drift）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0011-algorithm-layer-direct-call.md:49
#: f6aaddb4bfcf4c37a65c73bb793bbf75
msgid "缓解措施"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0011-algorithm-layer-direct-call.md:51
#: a0b18dd042dd47f491af12bceb660d1d
msgid "FacadeBridge 薄封装：集中处理异常翻译和结果 DTO 转换"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0011-algorithm-layer-direct-call.md:52
#: f1c8aa10155642de84065fa73a1ab798
msgid "e2m2e 算法层签名相对稳定（已被其自身测试套件覆盖）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0011-algorithm-layer-direct-call.md:53
#: c669abed13b14bbc9e440ca97b7ff84f
msgid "如果 Facade 未来补全返回完整数据，可切换回 Facade 路径"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0011-algorithm-layer-direct-call.md:55
#: d2ecf344971d41e9a674859761b3bdd8
msgid "修订（2026-08-17，e2m2e 5.7.1）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0011-algorithm-layer-direct-call.md:57
#: 9fe78afa84054d61bf3509e5adfd51fe
msgid ""
"轨道族生成改走 `Facade.orbit_family_generation`：5.7.1 起 Facade 响应 "
"（`FamilyGenerationResponse`）携带完整 `Orbit` 成员与状态三元组，软失败 保留部分族，七族统一入口。本 ADR "
"的前提（Facade 剥离轨道数据）对族生成 已不再成立；`design_orbit` / `control_orbit` "
"仍直调算法层（对应响应仍只 返回标量汇总）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0011-algorithm-layer-direct-call.md:63
#: 99c10410c1dc48e491f8a96ded03b795
msgid "修订（Tauri 架构起，v4.0.0）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0011-algorithm-layer-direct-call.md:65
#: 6fde427e16fb4a2b9e4e3f2d360c784f
msgid ""
"界面链路整体迁移到 e2m2e `serve-stdio` sidecar——算法只经 Facade 统一 入口进入界面（协议见 e2m2e "
"ADR 0035）。本 ADR 的直调决策在界面上已无 使用者；直调式薄封装保留在 "
"`src/engine/facade_bridge.py`，供脚本与测试。 “GUI 不再绕过门面直调算法层”见 "
"`docs/architecture/architecture.md`。"
msgstr ""

